      "text": "[7:35PM] #LagosIbadanExpress #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is very fluid exiting the Third Mainland bridge to Olopomeji, Ifako, Ogudu, Alapere, Apostolic, Ojota Bridge, Old Toll gate, Alausa by Magodo, Otedola Bridge, Berger and Kara.\n\nOur Men are strategically positioned along this route to ensure traffic is good.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
