      "text": "[8:02PM] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic in and out of VI is good at the moment.\n\n- Ahmadu Bello Way is good;\n- Adeola Odeku is good;\n- Akin Adesola is good;\n- Ajose Adeogun is good;\n- Adetokunboh Ademola is good;\n- Aboyade Cole is good;\n- Ozumba Mbadiwe is good;\n- Kofo Abayomi is good\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
